  "done": {
    "capabilityId": "member.readSavingsBalance",
    "title": "Read Member REGULAR SAVINGS Balance",
    "description": "Signs into MockCore Teller with the operator credentials, searches for a member by number (memberId), opens the member detail page, and reads the REGULAR SAVINGS (suffix S00) account balance from the accounts table into output 'savingsBalance'. Requires memberId plus operator credentials. Returns savingsBalance (e.g. \"$4,821.97\"). Exceptional outcome MEMBER_NOT_FOUND occurs when the member number does not exist, shown by the message \"No members matched your search.\""
  }
